      "created_at": "2022-02-09T20:26:48Z",
      "updated_at": "2022-02-09T20:26:48Z",
      "body": "It would be interesting to have at least an idea of the other regulations and what they say. Of course having it configurable would be awesome, but it wouldn't solve the possible issue of having a website targeted at users from several countries. I could see at least one of our clients migrate to Volto in the next 2 years. But this is just me trying to look at my crystal ball, so who knows.\r\n\r\nI heard, but I'm not entirely sure about this, that Japan has its own cookie/privacy law, for example.\r\n@terapyon sorry for bringing you into this without notice, but perhaps you might have some info about this? Or maybe a pointer to where we could find these info? :D",
